.TH start-cli-diagnostic-update 1  "update "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-diagnostic\-update \- Check for StartOS updates and update if available
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli diagnostic update\fR [\fB\-\-trust\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-progress\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check for StartOS updates and update if available
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-trust\fR
Install without requiring a trusted signer; signature and integrity checks remain mandatory
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR
Target version for update
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-progress\fR
Disable progress display
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
